From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:01:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] cheetah: stock TrustTokenService roots

zuma/gs201 0001 drop the trees' GoogleConfigOverlay in favour of
vendor/pixel-style's copy, which lacks the trust-token root keys stock
cheetah's GoogleConfigOverlay carries (vendor_required_trust_token_roots and
its timestamp). Copy them from stock into FrameworkResOverlayStockCheetah.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../AndroidManifest.xml                         |  2 +-
 .../res/values/stock.xml                        | 17 ++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cheetah/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayStockCheetah/AndroidManifest.xml b/cheetah/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayStockCheetah/AndroidManifest.xml
index de60c15..c3448cd 100644
--- a/cheetah/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayStockCheetah/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/cheetah/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayStockCheetah/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 -->
 <manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
     package="android.overlay.stock.cheetah">
-    <!-- Values stock cheetah (CP3A.261005.002.A1) sets and our build didn't; priority 1, above the tree's own overlays. -->
+    <!-- Values stock cheetah (CP3A.261005.002.A1) sets and our build didn't. Priority 1: nothing else sets them. -->
     <overlay
         android:isStatic="true"
         android:priority="1"
diff --git a/cheetah/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayStockCheetah/res/values/stock.xml b/cheetah/overlay/FrameworkResOverlayStockCheetah/res/values/stock.xml
index f335afa..5c9a58a 100644
